      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190909928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "workspaces\nsame code, one state per workspace\n\ndocvault: TF_WORKSPACE=local keeps the\nemulator state in terraform.tfstate.d/local/",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 100,
      "containerId": "04-where-the-state-lives/box-115",
      "originalText": "workspaces\nsame code, one state per workspace\n\ndocvault: TF_WORKSPACE=local keeps the\nemulator state in terraform.tfstate.d/local/",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "04-where-the-state-lives/pDF2Dov83fEelvl45kG8e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 860.1911315917969,
      "y": 4032.5,
      "width": 359.61773681640625,
      "height": 85,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1065840620,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1926812884,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190909928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "folders\nenvs/dev and envs/prod, each a small root\nmodule calling the same modules with\ndifferent values and its own backend",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 79,
      "containerId": "04-where-the-state-lives/box-116",
      "originalText": "folders\nenvs/dev and envs/prod, each a small root\nmodule calling the same modules with\ndifferent values and its own backend",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "04-where-the-state-lives/f4K24kKdDsxIoQX_IvaID",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1590.3660888671875,
      "y": 4032.5,
      "width": 299.267822265625,
      "height": 85,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1667928684,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1276058196,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190909928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "separate AWS accounts\ndev and prod in different accounts:\na mistake in dev cannot touch prod\n(the usual setup in companies)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 79,
      "containerId": "04-where-the-state-lives/box-117",
      "originalText": "separate AWS accounts\ndev and prod in different accounts:\na mistake in dev cannot touch prod\n(the usual setup in companies)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
